t of his career in the \"Lethal Weapon\" movies. He used his celebrity status and previous experience driving taxis to raise awareness about drivers who often ignored African Americans needing a ride. It prompted former New York City mayor, Rudy Giuliani, to pass the Operation Refusal Law, which stated that cab drivers could have their license suspended for refusing to stop for African Americans in need of a cab. Way to make a change,"
