ured Tangerine rather than his original Blue, on the basis that he was a Dundee United supporter, who play in Tangerine, as opposed to Dundee, who play in Blue.\n\nSadly, Geoffrey passed away in 2018, aged 76, after a bout of pneumonia.\n\nDanny Glover\n\nYes thats right, Danny Glover of Lethal Weapon fame as well as The Colour Purple, Witness and Predator"
