nd wholeheartedly. They find passion and enthusiasm contagious and enjoy being around people who bring excitement and energy into their lives.\n\n-\n\nDislike for Unforgiving Behavior: On the other hand, individuals born on September 7 strongly dislike unforgiving behavior. They believe in the power of forgiveness and reconciliation. They are willing to let go of past grievances and move forward, even if it means making compromises or sacrifices. They may struggle to understand those who hold grudges or harbor resentment, as they see it as a hindrance"
