might be the groundbreaking 'tackle' technique he brings on the sand. That's a new one for us, Jamie.\n\n7. Katrina Bowden\n\nKatrina's 30 Rock character, Cerie, definitely did not have as great of a serve as the one that the actress showcased at the iHeart Summer Celeb Volleyball Tournament in 2017. You be"
