 dad. Though USA men's volleyball won a bronze medal in 2016, the team did not medal in Tokyo.\n\n\"Heartbroken, but not broken,\" Matt wrote via Instagram. \"Saddened, but full of love. Older, wiser, and more experienced. Family first then Paris 2024.\"\n\nAugust 2020\n\nMatt and Jackie tied the knot in a ceremony surrounded by friends and family. The couple posted a slew of wedding photos, showing"
