 is not working, and we can't do this. We got to go our own separate ways. It was so, so hard because we really loved each other. He's a really special person and I love his soul and everything.\"\n\nCurrent relationship status: Broken up, but cordial.\n\nFun fact: Infidelity isn't easy for any couple to navigate, but it's nice to hear"
