y certain that she was going to break up with me,\" Perry wrote in his book, noting that he felt Roberts was \"slumming it\" by dating him.\n\nYasmine Bleeth\n\n1996\n\nSometimes life imitates art: Perry's \"Friends\" character, Chandler Bing, had a crush on Yasmine Bleeth following her turn"
